{"synopsis":"Ini adalah bagian pertama dari adaptasi serial online terkenal! Lucu dan penuh lelucon, pasti akan menghibur pembaca! T: Siapa Fang Jipan? Pastor Jenderal: Dia anak saya yang hilang. terisak terisak; Kaisar: Setiap kali dia membuka mulutnya, kepalaku sakit; setiap kali dia mendekat, aku ingin lari. Pangeran: Dia satu-satunya penyebab kesengsaraan saya, dan alasan saya selalu dicaci maki. Fang Jipan: Hai teman-teman! Apakah kamu merindukan saya? Ayah Jenderal, Tuhan, Pangeran: Kita harus pergi sekarang!","alternative_title":"明朝败家子, The Prodigal Son of Ming Dynasty, Míng Cháo Bài Jiā Zi, Kẻ Ăn Hại Triều Minh","author":"Yueguan Baishao Comic Studio (关白勺漫画工作室)","artist":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ac43e366-af65-4190-99e3-92cff1754875","number":"104","chapter":"104","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"3781b6c7-25b8-4fa4-9eff-f823c9eb7862","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"367173e7-b0c6-4e24-b5e4-e4b112e4361d","number":"102","chapter":"102","title":"","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21"},{"chapter_id":"e7c08fca-0bb6-4008-8d7a-6d66945679d7","number":"101","chapter":"101","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"e4af048a-cf59-4223-8420-e39b73978287","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2026-07-05","released":"2026-07-05"},{"chapter_id":"b7fd0e42-4089-436f-b3d2-cb223edccb0a","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"dcb8f928-485a-4d0f-8a8c-151fbd8a31e4","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2026-06-24","released":"2026-06-24"},{"chapter_id":"3bdaf717-a173-4341-a7e0-f328a8a4c22e","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17"},{"chapter_id":"07e21a54-63b0-42c8-af1e-d97b27edacf1","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14"},{"chapter_id":"ddc5b48a-d